WEBVTT

00:09.206 --> 00:11.167
The

00:20.930 --> 00:25.812
lights

00:28.613 --> 00:31.494
were bright

00:34.034 --> 00:41.060
But the room is cold Another story that's bored

00:41.160 --> 00:51.008
and sold I'm trying to find a reason why Beneath

00:51.068 --> 00:58.314
this plastic, empty sky

00:59.765 --> 01:05.910
When the world is spinning out of my control

01:06.331 --> 01:12.256
You're the one true thing that I can't hold

01:13.056 --> 01:16.639
Through the static and the driving rain You're

01:16.679 --> 01:22.296
the one who keeps me sane You are the shelter They

01:22.356 --> 01:26.480
