01:56.448 --> 02:00.171
to dust

02:02.830 --> 02:09.053
But when the world is spinning out of my control

02:09.694 --> 02:16.618
You're the one true thing that I can hold Through

02:16.658 --> 02:20.560
the static and the driving rain You're the one

02:20.600 --> 02:26.864
who keeps me sane You are the shelter You are the

02:26.884 --> 02:30.148
truth My anchor in this crazy year

02:43.957 --> 02:44.558
Hey.

03:04.068 --> 03:08.991
So let them talk, let them stare As long as you are

03:09.011 --> 03:13.894
standing there I'm not afraid of what's to come I

03:14.975 --> 03:19.978
know where I belong

03:22.860 --> 03:27.583
Cause when the world is spinning out of my

03:27.683 --> 03:33.747
control You're the one true thing that I can hold

03:36.375 --> 03:38.016
Through the static and the driving rain You're

03:38.036 --> 03:40.518
the one who keeps me sane You are the shelter, you

03:40.538 --> 03:42.820
are the truth My anchor in this crazy youth My

03:42.880 --> 03:43.200
anchor, my

03:43.220 --> 04:05.057


04:12.115 --> 04:12.416
You.

